# Normalise to LF in the repo and in every working copy, regardless of the
# contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier enforces endOfLine: 'lf' and
# .editorconfig agrees, so CRLF checkouts would fail `pnpm format:check`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must not touch
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pbf binary
*.osm.pbf binary
